5
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:30,230
and procurement strategy for the next quarter.

6
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:33,230
Absolutely. Glad to be here.

7
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:37,790
And yes, things have been pretty hectic on my side, especially with the new sustainability

8
00:00:37,790 --> 00:00:40,350
