9
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:42,870
But honestly, this discussion is overdue.

10
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:48,190
We've been operating under increasing pressure from both suppliers and internal stakeholders.

11
00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:51,430
So aligning our strategy is more important than ever.

12
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:52,630
Exactly.

13
