17
00:01:06,630 --> 00:01:11,750
So maybe we can start by reviewing where we currently stand in terms of operations.

18
00:01:12,740 --> 00:01:19,060
Sure, let me give you a brief overview. As of last month, our average supplier lead time

19
00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:24,900
