43
00:03:37,980 --> 00:03:43,180
Agreed. And speaking of reviews, I think we need to rethink our vendor's scorecard.

44
00:03:43,180 --> 00:03:48,860
Right now, it's focused too heavily on pricing and on-time delivery, but modern supply chains

45
