to push for digital integration. Even basic EDI or API connections would make a huge difference.

58
00:04:51,580 --> 00:04:57,900
Absolutely. Automation, real-time data sharing would remove half the surprises we experience

59
00:04:57,900 --> 00:05:04,180
today. And if suppliers can provide consistent updates, order confirmations, shipping...

60
00:05:04,180 --> 00:05:08,980
Good morning. Thanks for making the time to sit down today. I know your schedule

61
00:05:08,980 --> 00:05:14,500
has been packed, and with the quarter closing, procurement topics have been piling up faster

