126
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:33,110
It's part of strategic sourcing. Speaking of strategic sourcing, have you given

127
00:09:33,110 --> 00:09:38,630
any more thought to whether we should diversify our supplier base? Right now, we rely heavily

128
00:09:38,630 --> 00:09:44,790
on three primary suppliers for nearly 80% of our raw material inputs. That feels risky.

129
00:09:44,790 --> 00:09:52,710
Very risky. And the current environment makes it riskier. Single source or limited

130
00:09:52,710 --> 00:09:58,230
