134
00:10:14,950 --> 00:10:18,310
Agreed. And something else has been bothering me.

135
00:10:18,310 --> 00:10:22,150
It's the lack of real-time visibility across our supply chain.

136
00:10:22,790 --> 00:10:25,990
We track shipments, but the data is fragmented.

137
00:10:25,990 --> 00:10:30,550
Our ERP shows one thing, the freight forwarder system shows something else,

138
00:10:30,550 --> 00:10:33,670
