139
00:10:34,550 --> 00:10:38,790
If we're serious about performance improvement, we need end-to-end visibility.

140
00:10:39,660 --> 00:10:39,900
Yes.

141
00:10:39,900 --> 00:10:48,050
Good morning. I hope you had a smooth commute today. I know the traffic around the industrial

142
00:10:48,050 --> 00:10:53,650
zone has been terrible this week. Morning. Yes, it took me a little longer than usual,

143
00:10:53,650 --> 00:10:58,210
but it's all good. I grabbed a coffee on the way to stay energized. I know we have a long

144
00:10:58,210 --> 00:11:01,890
discussion ahead regarding the supply chain bottlenecks and procurement strategy for the

145
00:11:01,890 --> 00:11:08,250
next quarter. Absolutely. That's precisely why I wanted us to sit together today. A lot

