00:11:08,250 --> 00:11:13,450
That has changed over the past few weeks, especially with the fluctuations in lead times

147
00:11:13,450 --> 00:11:18,050
and the unexpected delays from two of our main suppliers.

148
00:11:18,050 --> 00:11:23,090
Procurement has been stretched thin and supply chain operations have been reacting rather

