Supplier A in Malaysia has pushed their lead time from 22 days to nearly 36 days.

154
00:11:39,810 --> 00:11:43,850
Supplier B in India has been struggling with raw material shortages, which is affecting

155
00:11:43,850 --> 00:11:46,410
