158
00:11:53,530 --> 00:11:57,050
These shifts are creating ripple effects across the entire chain.

159
00:11:57,050 --> 00:11:58,050
Exactly.

160
00:11:58,050 --> 00:12:03,530
And what's even more worrying is the impact this is having on our production planning.

161
00:12:03,530 --> 00:12:09,850
When inbound materials don't arrive consistently, the factory floor ends up either overstocked

162
00:12:09,850 --> 00:12:12,050
