202
00:15:19,290 --> 00:15:24,490
approval. Absolutely. Speaking of planning, I think we need to strengthen the relationship

203
00:15:24,490 --> 00:15:30,810
between procurement, supply chain, and production planning. Right now, each team has their own

204
00:15:30,810 --> 00:15:36,890
set of priorities and sometimes communication becomes fragmented. True. I've seen situations

205
