214
00:16:08,850 --> 00:16:11,010
And not just occasional meetings.

215
00:16:11,010 --> 00:16:14,170
We need a structured process.

216
00:16:14,170 --> 00:16:15,170
Good morning.

217
00:16:15,170 --> 00:16:17,050
Thanks for making time to sit down today.

218
00:16:17,050 --> 00:16:20,190
