546
00:37:24,950 --> 00:37:29,270
One major challenge we've been facing is the lack of real-time visibility.

547
00:37:29,270 --> 00:37:34,530
Many of our suppliers still send order updates manually, via email or spreadsheets.

548
00:37:34,530 --> 00:37:38,230
That creates delays, errors, and communication gaps.

549
00:37:38,230 --> 00:37:42,270
If we want to improve performance, we need to push for digital integration.

550
00:37:42,270 --> 00:37:46,630
Even basic EDI or API connections would make a huge difference.

551
00:37:46,630 --> 00:37:47,950
Absolutely.

552
00:37:47,950 --> 00:37:54,070
Automation, real-time data sharing would remove half the surprises we experience today.

553
00:37:54,070 --> 00:37:59,190
And if suppliers can provide consistent updates, order confirmations, shipping...

